# November 19, 2026: Cochise County, Arizona (region az). A first county batch for Arizona: Tombstone's 1880s
# buildings, the Spanish presidio of 1775 on the San Pedro, the silver-mill ruins at Millville, Fort Bowie and the
# Butterfield station at Dragoon Springs, the Ghost Town Trail (Gleeson, Courtland, Pearce), and standing places in
# Bisbee, Douglas, Cochise and the Chiricahuas.
# Facts come from the linked sources only: Wikipedia articles read as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py), the managing
# bodies' pages (BLM, NPS, Arizona State Parks) read with tools/page.py, HMdb marker pages, and an Arizona Highways
# drive guide. Pins were looked at on Esri satellite (research/pincheck_az_qhns_*.jpg); each pin note says what that showed.
